    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27550" root="ظرف" body-key="Z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَا مَظْرَفَانُ</span></b>  is an expression similar to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَا مَلْكَعَانُ</span>
[and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكْذَبَانُ</span> &amp;c.; meaning <i>O thou who possessest
the quality,</i> or <i>qualities, of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظَرْف</span> <i>in a great,</i> or <i>an
extraordinary degree</i>]. (A, TA.)

